1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,167
The water is glass. Sam picks up the
prettiest shell he has ever seen.

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:08,200
Rule eleven! Put it down! Never pick
up a pretty shell!

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,800
The cone snail. It fires a venom dart
that can kill a grown man, and there
is no antidote.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,100
This island hates me personally.
